    "type": "game",
    "name": "Hoops Ahead: Basketball Manager",
    "steam_appid": 3326420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join The Hoops Ahead Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc0 Join the official Hoops Ahead Discord server with this code:\u00a0<strong><u>TMdZCEHH6N</u></strong> (or click <i>Discord </i>in the Steam page links section)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with other players and view news/updates about the game there!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new basketball league has been founded and you've been chosen by the commissioner to become the general manager of a team! Manage, trade, and sign players to help lead your franchise to a championship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEGIN YOUR GENERAL MANAGER JOURNEY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control and choose from a selection of basketball franchises to manage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle in with your initial roster of players and coaches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View each player's attributes, positions, and archetypes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY AND SIMULATE MATCHES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play and/or simulate matches with live play-by-play feedback and statistics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the match unravel with alerts to key moments such as game winners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare each team's percentages and largest leads during the match</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR WAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and propose trades to other teams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the trade market with the trade searcher tool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign free agents to an agreed upon salary and length in years</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEVELOP YOUR FUTURE STARS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your high potential players as they grow their attributes organically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain training tokens after each match you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the training tokens at the gym shop to purchase player attribute trainers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEEP UP WITH LEAGUE NEWS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch fans react to match results with social media posts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through featured player performance recaps posted by the league</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get informed of trades and signings reported by the press</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLIDIFY YOUR LEGACY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness your best players make the all-star match and win league awards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in the playoffs to reach the championship round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win the championship to be crowned as the greatest manager in the Hoops Ahead League</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new basketball league has been founded and you've been chosen by the commissioner to become the general manager of a team! Manage, trade, and sign players to help lead your franchise to a championship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEGIN YOUR GENERAL MANAGER JOURNEY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control and choose from a selection of basketball franchises to manage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle in with your initial roster of players and coaches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View each player's attributes, positions, and archetypes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY AND SIMULATE MATCHES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play and/or simulate matches with live play-by-play feedback and statistics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the match unravel with alerts to key moments such as game winners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare each team's percentages and largest leads during the match</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR WAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and propose trades to other teams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the trade market with the trade searcher tool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign free agents to an agreed upon salary and length in years</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEVELOP YOUR FUTURE STARS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your high potential players as they grow their attributes organically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain training tokens after each match you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the training tokens at the gym shop to purchase player attribute trainers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEEP UP WITH LEAGUE NEWS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch fans react to match results with social media posts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through featured player performance recaps posted by the league</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get informed of trades and signings reported by the press</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLIDIFY YOUR LEGACY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness your best players make the all-star match and win league awards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in the playoffs to reach the championship round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win the championship to be crowned as the greatest manager in the Hoops Ahead League</p></li></ul>",
